WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.760
Mark: You've got your scalpels...
Wade: Scalpels...

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:08.960
Mark: Over on the right
Wade: Yes.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.520
Mark : You pick those up with just your forefinger and your thumb.

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:11.020
Wade: Okay...

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:12.400
Mark: Very delicate, very delicate

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.660
Mark: Not telling you to do it now. Put down-- PUT DOWN THE SCALPEL!

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:15.680
Wade: Are you sure?

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:16.180
Mark: --Put it down!

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:16.720
Wade: I think we need it.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:17.260
Mark: PUT IT DOWN!

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:18.520
Wade: Ok, I'm dropping it.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.700
(Monitor Beeping)

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:24.440
(Flatline Sound)

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:25.720
Mark: This is what happened last time

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:26.680
Wade: Oh no...

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:28.460
Mark: Okay... Alright then.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:29.340
Wade: Well... Uh...

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:30.020
Mark: *Grunts*

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:31.560
Wade: D-do you know how to--

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.320
Mark: --Get the spoon...

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:38.220
Wade: Oh, I dropped  the spoon

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:42.440
Mark: Oh my God! That was the only tool we could use to scoop it out!

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:43.060
Wade: I-I got it...

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:44.180
Mark: Oh God!

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:44.780
Wade: I got it....

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:47.280
Mark: Wait shut up, shut up. There's another spoon, there's another spoon.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.040
Mark: Oh my God

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:53.400
Wade: Oh God...

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.020
Mark: Oh my God!!!!

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:57.820
Wade: Noooo!!

00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:58.700
Mark: F@%#!!

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:00.880
- Outro -

